[6.568894, "o", "\r\n"]
[7.769168, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m  the shop takes USDC. the wallet holds USDG and nothing else.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.769101, "o", "\u001b[2m  a wallet with no SOL cannot pay a fee. an agent alone stops here.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.369485, "o", "\r\n\u001b[38;5;220m  Gecko reads the shop, converts the money, checks the bill,\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.969604, "o", "\u001b[38;5;220m  and a fee relay pays the network so the buyer never needs SOL.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.76998, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m  running on a local copy of mainnet (:8899) with a relay (:8080).\u001b[0m\r\n"]
